          'The light is excellent: mist on meadows, soft gold in the evening. December holidays are the busiest weeks of the year, so book Tadoba core permits in the 60–120 day window. Families and first-timers usually prefer this season. Read <a href="/blogs/best-time-to-visit-tadoba/">best time to visit Tadoba</a> for one park in detail.',
